---
layout: base.njk
title: "Learn"
description: "Tutorials, video walkthroughs, interactive DSP module reference, Lean proofs & hardware profiles, and example tracks for Perception Studio."
---

<section class="section grid-backdrop" style="border-top:0">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Learn Perception Studio</p>
      <h1>Tutorials, videos &amp; reference</h1>
      <p>
        Master modular patching, granular and spectral engines, VST3 workflows, DSP proofs, and
        hardware profiles.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gallery-grid" style="margin-bottom:56px">
      <a class="blog-card" href="/learn/modules/">
        <div class="blog-body">
          <span class="card-tag">Reference</span>
          <h3>Modules &amp; Instruments</h3>
          <p>Interactive directory of all 37 DSP modules, physical models, 16-voice grain clouds, and VST3 hosting.</p>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a class="blog-card" href="/learn/proofs/">
        <div class="blog-body">
          <span class="card-tag is-monitor">DSP &amp; Hardware</span>
          <h3>Proofs &amp; Hardware Factory</h3>
          <p>Machine-checked Lean synthesis theorems, real-time Raspberry Pi 5 + HAT profiles, and JSON schema.</p>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a class="blog-card" href="/learn/tracks/">
        <div class="blog-body">
          <span class="card-tag is-mod">Compositions</span>
          <h3>Example Tracks</h3>
          <p>Hand-composed studio projects with real signal-flow routing breakdowns and studio captures.</p>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Tutorials &amp; video walkthroughs</h2>
      <p>Hands-on guides from first patch to hardware deployment.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="gallery-grid">
      {% for item in site.tutorials %}
      <a class="blog-card" href="{{ item.href }}">
        <div class="blog-body">
          <span class="card-tag">{{ item.tag }}</span>
          <h3>{{ item.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ item.summary }}</p>
        </div>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
